 "remarks": "Meticulously Maintained Waterfront Condo with River Views.  Meticulously maintained 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath condominium in a desirable waterfront complex featuring a private balcony overlooking the Norwalk River. This bright and spacious home offers new hardwood flooring throughout and an open-concept floor plan designed for comfortable living and entertaining.  The main living area includes a dining space and a welcoming living room with a cozy gas fireplace, creating the perfect setting for relaxing or hosting guests. The well-designed layout provides both functionality and style.  Residents enjoy the convenience of elevator access to every floor, including the secure garage. The unit includes one reserved parking space in the under-building garage, one additional reserved outdoor parking space, and a private storage room.  Enjoy low-maintenance waterfront living with beautiful river views, modern updates, and exceptional amenities in a sought-after Norwalk location.",
